  "details": "When hovering on the Gesture key-bind in the Controls page of the main menu settings on Desktop, the highlight circle texture used is stretched over the 8 keys and becomes an unsightly oval.\n\nThere is also an artifact caused by this in the form of a line at the bottom of the texture.\n\nI believe it should be either a pill shape, or individual circles for each key.\n\nI know this is the most mundane and nit-picky canny post ever, but this lives rent-free in my head, and I needed to do something about it.\n\nAs Kung points out, the Shift key should also be highlighted. Same for Shift+Esc which only highlights Escape.",
